The pagefeather engine

The pagefeather engine is a WebAssembly build made by the pagefeather project
(https://github.com/skyphusion-labs/pagefeather). This bundle ships its lean build:
the prerelease @LEAN_TAG@ (pagefeather-engine-lean.wasm sha256 @LEAN_WASM_SHA256@,
pagefeather-engine-lean.js sha256 @LEAN_JS_SHA256@), transformed for this bundle by
spikes/b2-wordpress/prepare.sh at this release's tag.
It is not PHP and is not endorsed by The PHP Group or Zend. It includes the
software below. The licence texts are in engine/notices/LICENSES/ in this
repository, and in LICENSES.tar.gz on each GitHub Release that ships the
engine, one file per component.

This product includes PHP software, freely available from
<http://www.php.net/software/>.

This product includes the Zend Engine, freely available at
<http://www.zend.com>.

